      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "with this request, poeople with poor laptops or old standalone quest 2s and old computers can go hangout in low capacity instances without running the risk of the instance filling up and making them lag heavily\n\nmeanwhile, the more performant devices can hangout in an instance with 80 people.",
