  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-05-18T06:10:59.476Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many times have I been to instances that have low caps. I know some worlds are set this way because maybe a game world or other. \n\nAllow an instance creator the chance to set the cap. \n\nWorld creators can still hard lock this cap for public instances but outside that allow the instance creator to have the power to set the cap.",
